  "notes": [
    "Preserve evaluated constant annotations on declarations, generic/formal parameters and body-local declarations. Rewrite generic/typedef/private named annotation constructors using resolved elements.",
    "Method annotations are copied to retained wrappers and executing helpers, including annotated class/method type parameters and formal offsets.",
